## 14. Risk Mitigation

| Risk | Probability | Impact | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|---|
| Jetson thermal throttling | High | Critical | Passive cooling + 5 W TDP + dynamic frequency scaling |
| Neural network instability | Medium | Medium | Lipschitz bounds, command validation, PID fallback |
| Inference latency exceeds budget | Medium | High | Profiling before flight; fallback to 250 Hz loop or simplified model |
| Sim‑to‑real gap | Medium | High | Real‑world fine‑tuning with quantitative stopping criterion |
| CAN communication failure | Low | High | CAN‑FD hardware FIFO, checksums, fallback to last valid command |
| Symbolic extraction overfitting | High | Low | Held‑out test set, physical plausibility checks |

